# For No One, bridge (figure 99.2)
# Ten bars in c#, which Pollack also reads as ii of B. In the last bar the F# chord's 6/4 resolves
# to 5/3 (a double appoggiatura over V, not a I6/4 moving to V), shown here as two halves.
